    "adHtml": "<h3>Remote, Philippines | Full-time exclusive contractor</h3>\n<h3>Who you are joining</h3>\n<p>Wunder Management is a European-led creator growth agency with a 25-person remote team. A large part of our team is based in the Philippines, including long-standing team members who now own key parts of our operations.</p>\n<p>In the last three years, our content has generated more than 3 billion organic views across Instagram and TikTok. One of our biggest growth stories took a creator from around 5,000 to 700,000 Instagram followers.</p>\n<p>You will join people who work inside social media every day—not a traditional agency watching from the outside.</p>\n<p>Lauris on Instagram: <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lauris_kalnins/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.instagram.com/lauris_kalnins/</a><br>Wunder Management: <a href=\"https://wundermgmt.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://wundermgmt.com/</a></p>\n<h3>The role</h3>\n<p>We are hiring one experienced short-form editor to lead our editing department. This is a real department-ownership role, not an assistant position or a generic operations job.</p>\n<p>You will own editing quality, output, deadlines and reporting; lead and QA the editors; work closely with our Creator Manager; and build practical AI and variation systems that help us distribute more winning content.</p>\n<p>You must still be excellent at editing Reels and TikToks yourself. Strong leaders stay close enough to the work to spot weak hooks, slow pacing and missed opportunities.</p>\n<h3>What you will own</h3>\n<ul><li>Lead the editing team and keep output on schedule</li><li>Review short-form edits for hooks, pacing, retention and platform fit</li><li>Set clear scorecards for quality, output and deadlines</li><li>Coach strong editors and handle underperformance directly</li><li>Give creators production-specific feedback when their footage limits the final edit</li><li>Work closely with the Creator Manager so creator plans and editing priorities stay aligned</li><li>Build practical AI workflows and improve our Variation Factory</li><li>Report what is finished, what is late and what needs a decision without being chased</li><li>Take an editing shift when needed to stay sharp and remove a bottleneck</li></ul>\n<p>The Creator Manager owns normal creator relationships. You own production-specific feedback and the editing system.</p>\n<h3>The business</h3>\n<p>Our creators monetize through subscription platforms including OnlyFans. Most public content is made for Instagram and TikTok, but you must be comfortable working professionally with lingerie, bikini and OnlyFans-adjacent creator content.</p>\n<h3>You should apply if</h3>\n<ul><li>You have direct experience editing Reels or TikToks for creators or personal brands</li><li>You can show three strong public short-form examples and explain your choices</li><li>You have led editors, owned QA or managed creative deadlines</li><li>You understand hooks, pacing, retention and repeatable content formats</li><li>You use data to change edit styles instead of defending personal taste</li><li>You communicate early and clearly when output is behind</li><li>You can handle underperformance directly</li><li>You have reliable internet and a real backup internet connection for outages</li></ul>\n<h3>Working hours</h3>\n<p>Your schedule must fully overlap with normal Riga working hours:</p>\n<ul><li>Monday–Saturday availability</li><li>About 2:00 PM–11:00 PM during European summer time</li><li>About 3:00 PM–12:00 AM during European winter time</li><li>Sunday off, apart from rare urgent problems</li></ul>\n<h3>Compensation</h3>\n<ul><li>$700 USD fixed monthly contractor fee</li><li>Up to $700 USD monthly performance bonus</li><li>$1,400 USD maximum monthly compensation</li><li>Full-time, exclusive contractor agreement</li></ul>\n<p>The fixed fee is guaranteed under the contract. The bonus is earned, not automatic. We pay on time, give strong people meaningful ownership and want this person to grow with the company.</p>\n<h3>Hiring process</h3>\n<ol><li>Written application and portfolio review</li><li>First interview</li><li>Paid practical trial</li><li>Final decision with the founder</li></ol>\n<p>By applying, you agree that we may review your submission for hiring purposes. Privacy policy: <a href=\"https://wundermgmt.com/imprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://wundermgmt.com/imprint</a></p>",
