    "adHtml": "<h3>Compensation:</h3>\n<p>$500/month base + $200–$300 per contract signed<br>Top performers earn $1,200–$1,800+/month<br><strong>Hours:</strong> Full-time, European Time Zone<br><strong>Location:</strong> Fully remote</p>\n<h3>🚀 About Wunder Management</h3>\n<p>We are one of Europe’s fastest-growing OnlyFans creator agencies — helping creators scale to $30K+/month and beyond through Instagram-first growth systems and elite sales execution.<br>This is not a VA position. This is a performance role inside a serious, fast-moving company.</p>\n<h3>About The Role</h3>\n<p>This is a <strong>DM-based sales role</strong>.<br>80–90% of your work is:</p>\n<ul><li>Instagram DMs</li><li>WhatsApp chats</li><li>Text-based qualification</li><li>Booking calls (not running them)</li></ul>\n<p>If you prefer phone calls over chat, <strong>do not apply</strong>.</p>\n<h3>What You'll Do:</h3>\n<p>You will chat as Lauris, the Co-Founder of Wunder, with leads and book calls for him.</p>\n<p>This requires discretion, strong judgment, and the ability to represent a founder-level personal brand professionally.</p>\n<h3>Inbound (Daily)</h3>\n<ul><li>Chat with inbound creator leads from Instagram ads</li><li>Qualify creators <strong>inside Whatsapp and Instagram DMs</strong></li><li>Move conversations toward WhatsApp &amp; booked calls</li><li>Keep lead flow organized in Pipedrive</li></ul>\n<h3>Outbound (Daily)</h3>\n<ul><li>Find and reach out to creators on Instagram</li><li>Write natural, non-corporate opening messages</li><li>Build your own outbound pipeline</li><li>Create opportunities — not wait for them</li></ul>\n<p>This role combines <strong>social awareness + sales judgment + speed</strong>.<br>YOU’RE A STRONG FIT IF YOU:</p>\n<ul><li>Are <strong>fast and natural in Instagram DMs</strong></li><li>Prefer <strong>chat over calls</strong></li><li>Have experience in:</li><li>Influencer / OF agencies</li><li>Social media outreach</li><li>Community management</li><li>Chat-based sales or recruiting</li><li>Can qualify people without sounding scripted</li><li>Take ownership and don’t need hand-holding</li><li>Want to grow into senior / lead responsibility</li></ul>\n<p>DO NOT APPLY IF:</p>\n<ul><li>You mainly want to do phone calls</li><li>Your experience is only banking / insurance / solar</li><li>You rely on scripts instead of judgment</li><li>You’re uncomfortable doing outbound IG DMs</li><li>You need constant supervision</li></ul>\n<p>TOOLS YOU’LL USE<br>Instagram • WhatsApp • Pipedrive • Calendly • Google Drive • Discord</p>\n<p>FINAL NOTE<br>We only review applications that show <strong>real DM skill</strong>.<br>If you’re great at chat, this role will feel obvious.<br>If not, it will feel uncomfortable — and that’s intentional.</p>\n<h3>🔗 Learn More About Us</h3>\n<p>Instagram (Co-Founder):<br>&lt;<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lauris_kalnins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.instagram.com/lauris_kalnins</a>&gt;<br>Website:<br><a href=\"https://wundermgmt.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><a href=\"https://wundermgmt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://wundermgmt.com</a></a></p>\n<h3>📩 How to Apply</h3>\n<p>Apply through the form below.<br>We’ll only review submissions that show clear previous experience in a role like this.</p>",
