    "adHtml": "<h3>Remote Chat Sales Agent</h3>\n<h3>Philippines | Full-time contractor | Fully remote</h3>\n<p>Wunder Management is a European creator agency with a 25-person team. Our creators have generated 3+ billion organic Instagram and TikTok views.</p>\n<h3>What you will do</h3>\n<ul><li>Manage live written sales conversations for one assigned creator and shift</li><li>Build rapport and handle several conversations at once</li><li>Recommend relevant digital offers</li><li>Follow approved pricing, account voice and sales systems</li><li>Keep clear notes and follow-ups</li><li>Hit sales, response-time, accuracy and quality targets</li></ul>\n<p>This is a sales role, not customer support or a general VA position.</p>\n<h3>Who we are looking for</h3>\n<ul><li>Proven experience selling through chat</li><li>BPO, remote sales or creator-account experience is an advantage</li><li>Strong written English</li><li>Prior remote-work experience</li><li>Stable internet, backup internet and backup power</li><li>Reliable attendance and fast response times</li></ul>\n<h3>Pay</h3>\n<ul><li>$2/hour base</li><li>3% individual commission</li><li>Monthly sales, quality, attendance and team bonuses</li></ul>\n<p>Strong chat sellers can realistically earn $700–$2,500+ per month, depending on performance and hours worked.</p>\n<h3>Schedule</h3>\n<ul><li>One assigned 8-hour shift, 6 days per week</li><li>4 AM–12 PM, 12 PM–8 PM or 8 PM–4 AM Philippines time</li><li>You normally stay with one creator and one primary shift</li><li>Overnight work is normal</li><li>Mandatory overtime may extend some workdays to 12 hours</li></ul>\n<h3>Role environment</h3>\n<p>This role supports subscription-based creator accounts that may include mature 18+ material. Apply only if you are comfortable in that environment.</p>\n<h3>Learn more about us</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://wundermgmt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://wundermgmt.com</a><br><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lauris_kalnins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.instagram.com/lauris_kalnins</a></p>\n<p>Privacy: <a href=\"https://wundermgmt.com/imprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://wundermgmt.com/imprint</a></p>",
