    "adHtml": "<h3>QUALITY CONTROL MONITOR (CHAT TEAM)</h3>\n<p><strong><em>This is a performance-driven operations role.</em></strong><br><strong><em>If you are looking for a simple VA or admin job, do not apply.</em></strong></p>\n<h3>Who We Are</h3>\n<p>Wunder Management is one of Europe’s leading creator management agencies.<br>We work with high-performing OF creators across social media and subscription-based platforms, supporting their content, operations, and audience management at scale.<br>Our internal chat operations rely on <strong>systems, accountability, and daily performance tracking</strong>.<br>To maintain high standards across shifts, we run strict Quality Control processes that ensure consistency, accuracy, and discipline across the team.</p>\n<h3>Job Description</h3>\n<p>This is an operations + quality assurance role.<br>You will:</p>\n<ul><li>Monitor chatters in real time during their shift</li><li>Ensure attendance, speed, accuracy, and correct execution</li><li>Identify mistakes, flag issues, and enforce standards</li><li>Review conversations and evaluate quality</li><li>Train and correct chatters based on errors</li><li>Maintain shift reports and performance logs</li><li>Keep the team aligned with scripts, persona, and guidelines</li></ul>\n<p>You are the person who ensures the system runs correctly.</p>\n<h3>What Do We Offer?</h3>\n<ul><li>Total monthly compensation ranges from <strong>$480-$1000</strong> based on performance</li><li>$480/month base with monthly bonuses on top for team performance</li><li>Stable long-term role with daily structure</li><li>Training, SOPs, and systems provided</li><li>Growth opportunities in a fast-scaling agency</li></ul>\n<h3>Who This Role Is For</h3>\n<p>This role fits people who:</p>\n<ul><li>Are detail-oriented and highly organized</li><li>Excel under structure and strict procedures</li><li>Enjoy monitoring performance and enforcing standards</li><li>Have strong leadership and communication skills</li><li>Understand sales psychology and customer interaction</li><li>Can work 6 days/week</li><li>Thrive in fast-paced environments</li><li>Prefer responsibility, ownership, and consistency</li></ul>\n<h3>Who This Role Is NOT For</h3>\n<p>This is not a fit if you:</p>\n<ul><li>Prefer low-intensity work</li><li>Hate monitoring people or giving corrective feedback</li><li>Struggle with confrontation or enforcing rules</li><li>Are disorganized or easily distracted</li><li>Want a relaxed job without accountability</li></ul>\n<h3>Requirements</h3>\n<ul><li>Strong written English</li><li>Ability to evaluate conversations objectively</li><li>Experience in team management, BPO oversight, or QA (preferred)</li><li>Strong analytical skills</li><li>High attention to detail</li><li>Fast, stable internet</li><li>Laptop or desktop</li><li>Leadership mindset with the ability to correct people clearly</li></ul>\n<p>Find out more about our company and our Co-Founder Lauris here:<br><a href=\"http://wundermgmt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://wundermgmt.com</a><br>&lt;<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lauris_kalnins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.instagram.com/lauris_kalnins</a>&gt;</p>\n<p>Fill out the form below.<br>Shortlisted candidates will be contacted with next steps.</p>\n<p>By applying, you agree that we may review your submission for hiring purposes. Privacy policy: <a href=\"https://wundermgmt.com/imprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://wundermgmt.com/imprint</a></p>",
