    "adHtml": "<h3>Remote, Philippines | Full-time exclusive contractor</h3>\n<h3>Who you are joining</h3>\n<p>Wunder Management is a European-led creator growth agency with a 25-person remote team. A large part of our team is based in the Philippines, including long-standing team members who have grown with the company.</p>\n<p>In the last three years, our content has generated more than 3 billion organic views across Instagram and TikTok. One of our biggest growth stories took a creator from around 5,000 to 700,000 Instagram followers.</p>\n<p>You will join people who work inside social media every day—not a traditional agency watching from the outside.</p>\n<p>Lauris on Instagram: <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lauris_kalnins/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.instagram.com/lauris_kalnins/</a><br>Wunder Management: <a href=\"https://wundermgmt.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://wundermgmt.com/</a></p>\n<h3>The role</h3>\n<p>We are hiring a short-form Video Editor to turn creator footage into Reels and TikToks that people keep watching.</p>\n<p>We do not want an editor who only makes videos look clean. You will study what holds attention, use feedback and real performance data, and improve hooks, pacing and retention over time.</p>\n<h3>What you will own</h3>\n<ul><li>Edit short-form creator content for Instagram and TikTok</li><li>Build stronger hooks and tighter pacing</li><li>Follow Wunder’s editing standards and hit deadlines consistently</li><li>Learn from performance data and repeat what works</li><li>Communicate early when footage or deadlines create a problem</li><li>Work closely with the Head of Editing and take direct feedback well</li><li>Help the team improve reusable editing systems</li></ul>\n<h3>The business</h3>\n<p>Our creators monetize through subscription platforms including OnlyFans. Most public content is made for Instagram and TikTok, but you must be comfortable working professionally with lingerie, bikini and OnlyFans-adjacent creator content.</p>\n<h3>You should apply if</h3>\n<ul><li>You have professional video-editing experience</li><li>You have directly edited Reels or TikToks</li><li>You can show three strong public short-form examples</li><li>You understand hooks, pacing and retention</li><li>You can take feedback without defending personal taste</li><li>You are reliable with deadlines and communication</li><li>You have reliable internet and a real backup internet connection for outages</li></ul>\n<h3>Working hours</h3>\n<p>Your schedule must fully overlap with normal Riga working hours:</p>\n<ul><li>Five working days per week</li><li>About 2:00 PM–11:00 PM during European summer time</li><li>About 3:00 PM–12:00 AM during European winter time</li><li>The exact schedule and breaks will be agreed before you start</li></ul>\n<h3>Compensation</h3>\n<ul><li>$450 USD fixed monthly contractor fee</li><li>Up to $150 USD monthly performance bonus</li><li>$600 USD maximum monthly compensation</li><li>Full-time, exclusive contractor agreement</li></ul>\n<p>We pay on time, give editors clear feedback and reward exceptional results.</p>\n<h3>Hiring process</h3>\n<ol><li>Written application and portfolio review</li><li>First interview</li><li>Paid practical trial</li><li>Final decision</li></ol>\n<p>By applying, you agree that we may review your submission for hiring purposes. Privacy policy: <a href=\"https://wundermgmt.com/imprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://wundermgmt.com/imprint</a></p>",
