    "adHtml": "<h3>Performance-Based | Remote | Philippines</h3>\n<p>We are a European creator management agency working with high-performing OnlyFans creators.<br>We’re looking for a <strong>Lead Generation Specialist</strong> whose sole job is to <strong>find qualified creators on Instagram</strong> that match very specific criteria and pass them to our sales team.<br>This is <strong>not</strong> a sales role.<br>You do <strong>not</strong> message creators.<br>Your job is research + accuracy.</p>\n<h3>What You Will Do</h3>\n<ul><li>Research Instagram creators manually (no scraping tools)</li><li>Find <strong>European creators</strong> who match our criteria (Currently female creators):</li><li>Have an active subscription platform</li><li>Have <strong>at least one Instagram Reel with 10,000+ views</strong></li><li>Post high-quality, original content (not repost pages)</li><li>Are currently active on Instagram</li><li>Collect and submit leads with:</li><li>Instagram handle</li><li>Link to qualifying reel(s)</li><li>Link-in-bio link (if available)</li><li>Log leads cleanly in a shared Google Sheet / Notion</li></ul>\n<p>That’s it. No DMs. No selling. No calls.</p>\n<p>What Counts as a “Qualified Lead” (Important)<br>A lead is paid <strong>only if it meets ALL criteria</strong>:</p>\n<ul><li>European</li><li>Creators that match our client criteria (currently female creators)</li><li>Has an active subscription platform</li><li>At least one Reel with <strong>10k+ views</strong></li><li>Real creator account (not agency-run pages, not meme pages)</li><li>Not already contacted by our team</li></ul>\n<p>Clear rules = no confusion.</p>\n<h3>Compensation (Performance-Based)</h3>\n<ul><li><strong>$1.00 per approved qualified lead</strong></li><li>No cap on earnings</li></ul>\n<p>A good specialist typically finds <strong>10-25 qualified leads per day</strong>.</p>\n<p>This means:</p>\n<ul><li>~$300–750/month</li><li>More if you are fast and accurate</li></ul>\n<h3>Trial Period</h3>\n<ul><li>First 50 <strong>leads</strong> are a paid trial</li><li>We check for:</li><li>Accuracy</li><li>Speed</li><li>Consistency</li><li>Strong performers get <strong>long-term work</strong></li></ul>\n<h3>Requirements</h3>\n<ul><li>Based in the <strong>Philippines</strong></li><li>Strong attention to detail</li><li>Comfortable using Instagram daily</li><li>Able to follow clear instructions exactly</li><li>Reliable internet + availability during EU-friendly hours (flexible)</li><li>Instagram native</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Find out more about our company and our Co-Founder Lauris here:</strong><br><a href=\"https://wundermgmt.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://wundermgmt.com/</a><br>&lt;<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lauris_kalnins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.instagram.com/lauris_kalnins</a>&gt;</p>\n<p>Experience as a VA or researcher is a plus, but <strong>not required</strong> if you’re sharp.</p>\n<p>By applying, you agree that we may review your submission for hiring purposes. Privacy policy: <a href=\"https://wundermgmt.com/imprint\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://wundermgmt.com/imprint</a></p>",
